# All I Luxe
 
All I Luxe is a premium online marketplace dedicated to buying and selling high-quality luxury furniture. The platform connects discerning buyers with elegant, timeless pieces while providing sellers with an easy way to showcase luxury furniture.
 
## Features
 
- Luxury furniture catalogue
- User registration and login
- Buy and sell furniture
- Responsive modern design
- Contact and enquiry forms
- Elegant luxury-inspired user interface
 
## Technologies Used
 
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Git & GitHub
 
## Project Goal
 
To create a sophisticated online marketplace focused exclusively on luxury furniture, delivering a seamless and visually appealing shopping experience.
 
